  "description": "*“What was going through your mind?”*\n\nYe-Rim Han was an ordinary student who loved filming until one day, she started hearing the thoughts of anyone captured in a photo or video. However, this ability brings her nothing but torment as she attempts to navigate her film and video production program without being overwhelmed by everyone’s thoughts. Soon after, Ye-Rim meets Jin-Ho Cha, a performing arts student who confides in her about his own ability. As the two work together to overcome their shared aversion to being in front of and behind the camera, they find themselves falling for each other.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
